message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CA-SSN Field Data Manager"
abstract: "Desktop application for the California Sentinel Sites for Nature (CA-SSN) program that ingests camera trap and acoustic recorder SD cards, standardizes file naming, extracts per-file metadata with checksums and provenance, runs data quality checks, and prepares data for Box, Wildlife Insights, and Wildlife SoundHub."
authors:
  - family-names: Imperato
    given-names: John T.
